# weak_spool_alt_slow_lift.scn — ALT_HOLD auto-takeoff, motors that lift SLOWLY (health 0.88), the ToF reads valid: NOT aborted, the craft lifts and flies
#                                ALT_HOLD の自動離陸、「ゆっくり」浮くモータ（健全度 0.88）、ToF は有効: 中止しない。機体は浮いて飛ぶ
#
# The case that the 7th-pass rule (abort when the accelerometer shows no evidence of leaving the floor 5 s after TAKEOFF) got wrong: a craft that lifts slowly shows no upward
# acceleration, so it was DISARMED at 0.11-0.17 m and fell at 1.2-1.6 m/s. Spec under test (8th pass, decision D4): the abort needs the POSITIVE evidence of the healthy ToF (a valid reading
# at or below 5 cm that does not rise); this craft's reading rises (0.02 -> 0.17 m), so there is no abort. The takeoff completes (the controller's backstop, once the evidence is gone)
# and the craft flies; the landing at the end is gentle.
#
# 7 回目の規則（TAKEOFF の 5 s 後に加速度計が床を離れた証拠を示さなければ中止）が誤った場面: ゆっくり浮く機体は上向きの加速を示さないので、0.11〜0.17 m で DISARM され、
# 1.2〜1.6 m/s で落下した。検証する仕様（8 回目、判断 D4）: 中止には健全な ToF の「積極的な」証拠（5 cm 以下の有効な読みで、増えない）が要る。この機体の読みは増える
# （0.02 → 0.17 m）ので、中止しない。離陸は完了し（証拠が消えた後の制御器の備え）、機体は飛ぶ。最後の着陸は穏やか。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/weak_spool_alt_slow_lift.scn --target vehicle --duration 25000000
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt>
   0    tof_deadzone 0
   0    fault 0 0.88
   0    fault 1 0.88
   0    fault 2 0.88
   0    fault 3 0.88
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50                       # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        1              # B: ALT switch ON while DISARMED
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     300       50        1              # C: ARM in ALT_HOLD (5.5 s)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     12000     50        1              # D: stick centre: the craft lifts slowly (the takeoff completes at about 10 s), flies in ALT_HOLD
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     3000      50        1              # E: release the ARM button (to 24.3 s): ALT_HOLD lands
